,\"snippet\":\" ... Or, should I say the character who appears in the title? Either way, it's Yellowstone and every one knows it! No more parks masquerading as alien worlds.\\n\\nWhere Did Costner Draw His Inspiration?\\n\\nAccording to Kieran Fisher, Costner drew inspiration from the numerous real-life ranchers who ... \",\"title\":\"https://morethanjustparks.com/national-park-tv-shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d73\"},\"ref\":\"d73\",\"snippet\":\" ... Smith about his real-life rodeo experiences and comment on Jamie's transformation in Season 3.\\n\\n- 11m 50s\\n\\n- 06/22/2020\\n\\n1923: Behind the Story\\n\\n- Behind the Story - A Dream and a MemoryThe cast discusses Alex and Spencer's reunion, the shootout at the Livingston train station, the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.paramountnetwork.com/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d72\"},\"ref\":\"d72\",\"snippet\":\" ... Network\\n\\n- Showrunner\\n\\n- Taylor Sheridan\\n\\nCast\\n\\n-\\n\\nJohn Dutton\\n\\n-\\n\\nKayce Dutton\\n\\n- Writers\\n\\n- John Coveny, Ian McCulloch\\n\\n- Seasons\\n\\n- 5\\n\\n- Streaming Service(s)\\n\\n- Paramount Plus, Peacock\\n\\n- Creator(s)\\n\\n- Taylor Sheridan, John Linson\\n\\n- Story By\\n\\n- Taylor Sheridan\\n\\n22 Michael Gaston\\n\\nAppears in: 'Yellowstone', 'Mayor of Kingstown'\\n\\nMichael Gaston played Morass, a police officer ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/taylor-sheridan-actors-multiple-shows-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d74\"},\"ref\":\"d74\",\"snippet\":\" ... When the audience met the generations that preceded him on 1923, a guessing game even among the franchise cast began about which character Sheridan would reveal to be the Dutton son who begins the Yellowstone flagship's family line.\\n\\nSome viewers believed Spencer was John's grandfather, and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/feature/yellowstone-character-guide-dutton-family-tree-1235593911/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... Native American Culture\\n\\nThe series features prominent Native American characters and storylines, shedding light on contemporary Indigenous issues. Chief Thomas Rainwater, played by Gil Birmingham, represents tribal interests and sovereignty. His character challenges stereotypes by portraying a savvy businessman and political leader.\\n\\nYellowstone depicts reservation life, showcasing both ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.factualamerica.com/yellowstone/yellowstones-portrayal-of-power-dynamics-in-rural-montana\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d75\"},\"ref\":\"d75\",\"snippet\":\" ... With the first installment of The Real Housewives franchise, The Real Housewives of Orange County, becoming an out-of-the-gate success, the franchise has spawned numerous installments that have each become money-making machines for both the cast and Bravo.\\n\\nHow does The Real Housewives make its ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/tv-shows-highest-grossing/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d77\"},\"ref\":\"d77\",\"snippet\":\" ... This is normal life-on-the–ranch stuff, and it all ended up in Yellowstone (actor Jefferson White, who plays Jimmy, got the stallion honors).\\n\\nThen, a couple of months later, a turn of fate: Marion died and Sheridan received a call from the estate. The ranch was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-features/taylor-sheridan-yellowstone-interview-1235519261/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d182\"},\"ref\":\"d182\",\"snippet\":\" ... Oftentimes, when TV characters are written off, the writers leave room for them to return to the show. Sometimes, however, you can't count on your fave coming back because their fate is more final.\\n\\nWarning: Spoilers ahead, including MAJOR spoilers for Yellowstone Season 5, Part 2 and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/kristenharris1/tv-characters-who-were-killed-off-when-actors-left\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2c1baefa2ea0cdaa276194be3e2dc554ad7bb008c539e1f7469824672f8b59c8\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"7155106e1a106357bb821664b9a3034021e0866e729df89bced53e944b5806fc\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Yellowstone cast real life relative plays unrelated character\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d87\"},\"ref\":\"d87\",\"snippet\":\" ... The only real plot-relevant role he serves is having someone for Basilio to pretend to die fighting, and one of his underlings secretly working for the Grimleal (although this is only revealed in throwaway dialogue and isn't relevant in the grand scheme of things).\\n\\n- In spite ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/PlotIrrelevantVillain\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\"