\",\"snippet\":\" ... his total screen time was roughly seven minutes. Addison Montgomery is a character from \\\"Grey's Anatomy.\\\" She is a neo-natal surgeon who was married to another doctor on the show, Derek Shepherd.\\n\\nHer character is the lead in a \\\"Grey's Anatomy\\\" spin-off called \\\"Private ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.funtrivia.com/trivia-quiz/Geography/State-Capital-Tribond-Trivia-267568.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d37\"},\"ref\":\"d37\",\"snippet\":\" ... Drama Series (Grey's Anatomy), Screen Actors Guild (2006)\\n\\n- Outstanding Performance by an Ensemble in a Drama Series (Grey's Anatomy), Screen Actors Guild (2007)\\n\\n- ACTRA Award of Excellence, ACTRA (2009)\\n\\n- Favorite TV Character We Miss Most (Dr. Christina Yang, Grey's Anatomy), People's Choice Awards (2015 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/sandra-oh\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"0708dd59ca85b119b524f2d4e010e87778d398524c90c68d9161ce0ffd92a896\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"84520b1b5d65c426982bf312ba64294261a73cf9e25f63d9097529343cfe1a52\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy character married multiple times children died\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d185\"},\"ref\":\"d185\",\"snippet\":\" ... The story brings the three women together in a way they never expected, as Meredith and Nina finally learn the secret of their mother's past.\\n\\nThis intimate portrait of a disintegrating marriage and the aftermath of war is full of hope, honour, loss and f